# CORE DASHBOARD SPEC (RCGEN Global App)

## Purpose
This document defines what happens after a user logs in.
The dashboard must change automatically depending on:

- Selected portal
- User role
- Permission level

RCGEN is a 4-in-1 system with separate login portals:
1. Core Governance
2. Educare (School)
3. Church
4. Foundation

---

# SYSTEM RULES

- The system must detect the selected portal.
- The system must detect the authenticated user role.
- The system must load only the data relevant to that portal.
- All actions must be logged for audit and compliance.

---

# 1️⃣ CORE GOVERNANCE DASHBOARD

Visible To:
- CEO
- Executive Directors
- Board Members
- Admin

Main Features:
- Organization-wide statistics
- Financial summary (all portals)
- Risk & compliance alerts
- Active projects overview
- Staff overview
- Quick access to all portals
- Reports & analytics panel

Security:
- Full access but logged
- Role-based restrictions on financial editing

---

# 2️⃣ EDUCARE (SCHOOL) DASHBOARD

Visible To:
- Principal
- Teachers
- Admin Staff
- Finance Officer

Main Features:
- Student count
- Class overview
- Attendance tracker
- Fee tracking status
- Teacher activity summary
- Parent communication center
- Academic reports

Security:
- Teachers only see their classes
- Finance role sees payment data
- Principal sees full school overview

---

# 3️⃣ CHURCH DASHBOARD

Visible To:
- Pastor
- Ministry Leaders
- Church Admin
- Finance Team

Main Features:
- Members count
- Service schedule
- Tithes & offerings summary
- Event management
- Ministry groups
- Prayer request management
- Volunteer scheduling

Security:
- Finance data restricted
- Ministry leaders only see their groups
- Pastor sees full overview

---

# 4️⃣ FOUNDATION DASHBOARD

Visible To:
- Foundation Manager
- Volunteers
- Admin
- Finance Officer

Main Features:
- Beneficiary count
- Feeding scheme statistics
- Donations tracker
- Volunteer management
- Project progress overview
- Community outreach reports

Security:
- Volunteers have limited edit rights
- Finance controls donation data
- Manager has full project visibility

---

# GLOBAL SECURITY RULES

- Role-based authentication required
- Portal-based data isolation
- Audit logging enabled
- Session timeout after inactivity
- Multi-factor authentication for leadership roles
